,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T12:12:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T12:12:07Z","body":"See my [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5994#issuecomment-1365041879):\r\n\r\n1. What resource types does this work for? It doesn't seem to work for custom format loaders (unless you send the notification manually). Perhaps we should add a note to the documentation?\r\n2. Does this work for subresources (nested within scenes or other resources)?\r\n3. We should probably add a note that this notification isn't sent when creating a resource in the Inspector or instantiating a resource through code (`MyResource.new()`), but only upon deserialization. That is, it's not equivalent to `Node._ready()` or a late constructor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596206963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596311799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3596311799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3596311799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WW1z3","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: