:29:41Z","body":"Seems like sub-resources will not receive the notification. It probably needs to be fixed.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime I updated the documentation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599326014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599737817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3599737817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3599737817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wj6PZ","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T01:39:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T01:39:04Z","body":"I did more testing with this PR and I was able to get the notification on sub-resources (with the code of this PR as it's now)\r\nIn my case, at the beginning, sub-resource where not getting the notification because the [default](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_resourceloader.html#class-resourceloader-method-load) `CacheMode` is `CACHE_MODE_REUSE`. When I changed the calls to load the resources with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP` all sub-resources where notified properly.\r\nAs far I can see, the code is working as it is.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599737817/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599758636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3599758636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3599758636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wj_Us","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T01:44:41Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T01:44:41Z","body":"Also I found that `ResourceLoader` has a [`_loaded_callback`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/io/resource_loader.h#L172)\r\nMaybe the notification could be sent before that callback is called (or update the code to allow more than one callback at the same time). That will also work regarding the cache, because the callback is called when the resource is actually loaded or when is get from the cache. Another advantage will be that the notification will work even for custom loaders (if I get the code correctly) ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3599758636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604207650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3604207650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3604207650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W09gi","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T22:23:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T22:23:35Z","body":"`_loaded_callback` is only used in the editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3604207650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621572041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3621572041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3621572041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7X3M3J","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-07T04:07:17Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T04:07:17Z","body":"I continued testing this PR on my game and I found that the notification was not sent for resource/subresources that I made unique.\r\nTrying to understand the reason behind not getting the notification, I opened the `.tres` file of that resource in an external editor and I saw that the sub resources that didn't got the call where declared as `[sub_resource type=\"Resource\" id=\"Resource_xxxxx\"]`\r\nSo I checked `ResourceLoaderText` and I found [where](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L549) those are handled.\r\nI fixed it adding this code after [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L718) line.\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tif (res.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\t\tres->notification(Resource::NOTIFICATION_RESOURCE_DESERIALIZED);\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\nTo be honest I don't fully get how `ResourceLoaderBinary` works so I'm not sure if a change like this one is also required there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621572041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3896620212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3896620212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3896620212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oQbS0","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T11:13:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T11:13:14Z","body":"Should be fixed now, sorry for the delay.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3896620212/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3901835774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3901835774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3901835774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7okUn-","user":{"login":"Zehir","id":845225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NTIyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/845225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir","html_url":"https://github.com/Zehir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-14T12:34:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T13:01:34Z","body":"> Yeah, it's more equivalent of `NOTIFICATION_SCENE_INSTANTIATED` 🤔 I think it's irrelevant when creating new resources, because their exported variables are always \"set\".\r\n\r\nOn the contrary, it would be preferable if he were also notified for a created resource. I would use this method to connect signals that are emitted from exported property setters.\r\n\r\nFor example I am using the notification to set the flag to false\r\n```gdscript\r\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY_TYPE, \"ThingModule\", PROPERTY_USAGE_DEFAULT) var modules: Array[ThingModule] = []:\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tmodules = value\r\n\t\tif not _is_deserialized:\r\n\t\t\treturn\r\n\t\tmodule_changed.emit()\r\n\t\tfor module in modules:\r\n\t\t\tif not is_instance_valid(module):\r\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\r\n\t\t\tif not module.property_list_changed.is_connected(module_changed.emit):\r\n\t\t\t\tmodule.property_list_changed.connect(module_changed.emit)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI could set the flag in the _init for resource creation but how can I differentiate a loaded resource vs a created resource ? Because at the point in time during the _init function the resource_path is not yet set.\r\n\r\nBut maybe it's out of scope of this PR and should be more like a NOTIFICATION_RESOURCE_READY notification ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3901835774/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3901871520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3901871520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3901871520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7okdWg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-14T12:59:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T12:59:06Z","body":"You can do something like\r\n```GDScript\r\nvar setup_queued: bool\r\n\r\nfunc _init():\r\n\tsetup_queued = true\r\n\tsetup.call_deferred()\r\n\r\nfunc _notification(what: int):\r\n\tif what == NOTIFICATION_RESOURCE_DESERIALIZED:\r\n\t\tsetup_queued = false\r\n\r\nfunc setup():\r\n\tif not setup_queued:\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\tstuff\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3901871520/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905054920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3905054920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3905054920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7owmjI","user":{"login":"Zehir","id":845225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NTIyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/845225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir","html_url":"https://github.com/Zehir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T19:34:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T19:34:14Z","body":"> You can do something like\r\n> \r\n> ```gdscript\r\n> var setup_queued: bool\r\n> \r\n> func _init():\r\n> \tsetup_queued = true\r\n> \tsetup.call_deferred()\r\n> \r\n> func _notification(what: int):\r\n> \tif what == NOTIFICATION_RESOURCE_DESERIALIZED:\r\n> \t\tsetup_queued = false\r\n> \r\n> func setup():\r\n> \tif not setup_queued:\r\n> \t\treturn\r\n> \tstuff\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nTell me if I am wrong but if I need to use something defined inside the `setup` method I won't be able to use is before the next frame;\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar foo = \"none\"\r\nfunc setup():\r\n\tif not setup_queued:\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\tfoo = \"bar\"\r\n```\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar thing: Thing = load(\"uid://foo\")\r\nprint(thing.foo) # \"bar\"\r\n```\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar thing: Thing = Thing.new()\r\nprint(thing.foo) # \"none\"\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905054920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905225173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3905225173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3905225173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oxQHV","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T21:34:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T21:34:24Z","body":"Yes, that's a caveat when using `call_deferred()`.\r\nThough you can just make \"bar\" be the default value of `foo`, no? I don't see why it can't be assigned immediately. (but I guess that's just a poor example xd)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905225173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905234918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3905234918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3905234918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oxSfm","user":{"login":"Zehir","id":845225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NTIyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/845225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir","html_url":"https://github.com/Zehir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T21:42:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T21:42:04Z","body":"> Yes, that's a caveat when using `call_deferred()`. Though you can just make \"bar\" be the default value of `foo`, no? I don't see why it can't be assigned immediately. (but I guess that's just a poor example xd)\r\n\r\nYes thats just a bad example, the real beavior is not that easy to explain in a fiew words but you can find the full script that I use here:\r\nhttps://github.com/Zehir/godot-thing-registry/blob/da3e405d9a687a310893ebc892def30e789a3392/addons/thing_registry/resources/thing.gd\r\n\r\nI am connecting signals and I don't wan't them to emit until all properties are loaded","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905234918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905262061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-3905262061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":3905262061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oxZHt","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T22:01:19Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T22:01:19Z","body":"I looked how feasible it would be to make the notification received when resource is created and it's not really possible. When a resource is being loaded, a new instance is created before properties are assigned, and it's not possible to differentiate it from regular creation. Thus it would need to be a separate notification, so out of scope for this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905262061/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4497480663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-4497480663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":4497480663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDBIb1w","user":{"login":"amazinggitboy","id":26547836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTQ3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26547836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy","html_url":"https://github.com/amazinggitboy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazinggitboy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T10:37:02Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T10:37:02Z","body":"Would love to see this go in, just hit this exact problem on my project. I have some classes which have exported parameters defining their data but build the in use dynamic aspects (which frequently change based on other things) at run time, and there's a lot of them and they're accessed a fair amount so this fix would be very useful for me. For now I'll have to use the 'last export setter hack' to cue things.\r\n\r\nCheers for the work on this.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4497480663/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4499129511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-4499129511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":4499129511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDCtEpw","user":{"login":"alessandrofama","id":26153311,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTUzMzEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26153311?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama","html_url":"https://github.com/alessandrofama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alessandrofama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T13:57:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T13:57:00Z","body":"I tested this PR with my GDExtension use case, and it works great!\r\n\r\nI have a custom resource created in GDExtension that needs to perform background loading and setup based on its stored properties right after it loads. This setup is required for the resource's other functions to work correctly.\r\n\r\nWithout this PR, the workaround required explicit initialization or lazy-loading, like this:\r\n```\r\n@export var test: CustomResource\r\n\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n    test.setup()\r\n    test.do_work()\r\n```\r\nAlternatively, I had to handle setup inside do_work() by tracking the initialization state under the hood.\r\n\r\nI tried moving the setup to `NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE`, but the resource's properties aren't deserialized yet at that point. My workaround was to emit a signal from the setter of the last declared property in the Resource, connect to it in `NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE` and do the setup when the connected function was called.\r\nThis PR completely removes the need for that workaround. Now, I can cleanly handle the setup directly within `NOTIFICATION_RESOURCE_DESERIALIZED`. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4499129511/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743314186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109752#issuecomment-4743314186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109752","id":4743314186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGrk7Cg","user":{"login":"98Luisma","id":54810123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODEwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54810123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma","html_url":"https://github.com/98Luisma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/98Luisma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T15:05:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:05:11Z","body":"I have been using this PR for a while, even shipped it in my project, and I have not encountered any issues with it. I have some Resources that need to check their exported properties at load time, so this has been a huge help.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/rep